Mutant: the reader accepts a frame without checking its CRC. Must fail: a frame with any one bit flipped is not valid; a frame with a flipped bit fails the reader; a last indexed transaction with a damaged frame ends the start with an error.
Apply from the repository root with git apply, and never commit it applied.

--- a/src/bin/pgcopydb/ld_spool.c
+++ b/src/bin/pgcopydb/ld_spool.c
@@ -195,8 +195,9 @@
 	pos = 0;
 	uint32_t crc = pgout_u32(buf + 4 + messageLength, &pos, 4);
 
-	if (crc != spool_frame_crc(buf, buf + 4, messageLength) ||
-		!spool_message_valid(buf + 4, messageLength))
+	(void) crc;
+
+	if (!spool_message_valid(buf + 4, messageLength))
 	{
 		return SPOOL_FRAME_BAD;
 	}
